  m_Text: "Melting Point of Naphthalene\n\nAim: Determine the melting point of naphthalene
    using the capillary tube method.\n\nApparatus: beaker, thermometer, Bunsen burner,
    tripod stand, wire gauze, glass stirrer, capillary tube, iron stand.\n\nYou'll
    crush, pack, attach, immerse, heat, and record your reading \u2014 just like
    the real practical. Mistakes affect your result, so take care at each step."
